Hi Elmar --

The initialize,eSet-method handles your case 'out-of the box', so there
is no need for an initialize,LeukoSet-method at all.  Specifically

## define LeukoSet class, inhert eSet class
setClass("LeukoSet", contains  = "eSet",
    representation=representation(leukoData = "AnnotatedDataFrame"),
    prototype=prototype(new("VersionedBiobase",
        versions = c(classVersion("eSet"),
            classVersion("AnnotatedDataFrame"),
            LeukoSet = "0.1.0"))))

## generic accessor function for the leukoData slot - abstract data type ADT
setGeneric("leukoData", function(object,...) standardGeneric("leukoData"))
setMethod("leukoData", signature("LeukoSet"),
          function(object,...) object at leukoData)

and you're ready to go:

