From: j.m.herbert at bham.ac.uk (John Herbert)
Date: Mon, 14 Dec 2009 17:55:01 +0000
Subject: [BioC] BLAST search sequence for species ID from R?
In-Reply-To: <927E266A-6C85-4677-9C19-EDD0749E2447@uni.no>
References: <d003a00f0912140302y38427637qd87082f26eacc27a@mail.gmail.com>
