From palmeira at biomserv.univ-lyon1.fr  Thu Dec 17 17:45:56 2009
From: palmeira at biomserv.univ-lyon1.fr (Leonor Palmeira)
Date: Thu, 17 Dec 2009 17:45:56 +0100
Subject: [BioC]  .qcdef file
Message-ID: <4B2A6044.60001@biomserv.univ-lyon1.fr>

Hello everybody,

this (old) thread was of very great help for my work on Bovine GeneChip. 
For the sake of archiving and for people out there working on unusual 
genomes, here is the bovinecdf.qcdef file I have built by looking for 
Gapdh and actin Probe Sets through the use of featureNames() on my chips:

array bovinecdf
alpha1 0.05
alpha2 0.065
spk bioB AFFX-r2-Ec-bioB-3_at
spk bioC AFFX-r2-Ec-bioC-3_at
spk bioD AFFX-r2-Ec-bioD-3_at
spk creX AFFX-r2-P1-cre-3_at
ratio actin3/actin5 AFFX-Bt-actin-3_at AFFX-Bt-actin-5_at
ratio actin3/actinM AFFX-Bt-actin-3_at AFFX-Bt-actin-M_at
ratio gapdh3/gapdh5 AFFX-Bt-gapd-3_at AFFX-Bt-gapd-5_at
ratio gapdh3/gapdhM AFFX-Bt-gapd-3_at AFFX-Bt-gapd-M_at

Best,
Leonor.

