Hi Natassa,
  From that warning message, i'd change the first line to "array
drosophila2cdf" (without quotes).
If you perform RMA normalisation, get the probeset names that are on
the array via rownames(exprs(rmaData)), and make sure that the
probesetIDs that you've put in the qcdef file (AFFX-BioB-3_at etc...)
are actually on the chip.

I know the new generation "Gene/Exon ST" arrays now using numerical
probeset ID's, thus AFFX-BioB-3_at etc does not exist on these chips
any more.

cheers,
Mark
